    info=Info(
        description=Markdown(
            "## Asynchronous delivery\n"
            "\n"
            "RabbitMQ 3.13 AMQP message broker used to fan-out async tasks from the API to Celery workers, including webhook dispatch and notification delivery.\n"
            "\n"
            "> **Illustrative sample notes:** the checks below are design and runbook examples, not claims about an active deployment.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Responsibilities\n"
            "\n"
            "| Area | Review focus |\n"
            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| Publishing | Enqueue work after the originating change is committed |\n"
            "| Consumption | Track acknowledgements, retries, and failed deliveries |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Trigger a test notification and follow it from API to worker.\n"
            "2. Interrupt the consumer and verify the expected redelivery behavior.\n"
            "   - Capture the relevant request or job identifier.\n"
            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** A retried message can repeat a side effect unless the handler is idempotent.\n"
            "\n"
            "Suggested diagnostic signals: *queue depth, oldest message age, and unacknowledged deliveries*. Compare them over the same time window.\n"
            "\n"
            "```text\n"
