            "> **Illustrative sample notes:** the checks below are design and runbook examples, not claims about an active deployment.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Responsibilities\n"
            "\n"
            "| Area | Review focus |\n"
            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| Jobs | Notifications, exports, webhooks, and bulk operations |\n"
            "| Retries | Record attempts and prevent duplicate external side effects |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Queue an export for a small test project.\n"
            "2. Retry a failed webhook and inspect the delivery record.\n"
            "   - Capture the relevant request or job identifier.\n"
            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** Long exports can starve short notification jobs when they share capacity.\n"
            "\n"
            "Suggested diagnostic signals: *oldest queued task, retry count, and execution duration*. Compare them over the same time window.\n"
