proxy_block = Manifest(
    name="Proxy",
    icon="🔀",
    classification=Classification.network_gateway,
    tags=["proxy", "nginx", "infra"],
    connections=[
        Manifest(name="Web App"),
        Manifest(name="Admin Panel"),
        Manifest(name="Spaces"),
        Manifest(name="API Server"),
        Manifest(name="Live Server"),
    ],
    info=Info(
        description=Markdown(
            "## Application ingress\n"
            "\n"
            "Nginx reverse proxy that acts as the single ingress point for all Plane traffic. Routes requests to Web, Admin, Space, API, and Live services. Also handles file upload size limits and serves MinIO uploads.\n"
            "\n"
            "> **Illustrative sample notes:** the checks below are design and runbook examples, not claims about an active deployment.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Responsibilities\n"
            "\n"
            "| Area | Review focus |\n"
            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| Routing | Send UI, API, and live traffic to the appropriate service |\n"
            "| Limits | Align upload size and timeout policies across the request path |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Load the main UI and establish a live editing session through ingress.\n"
            "2. Upload a file near the configured size limit and inspect error feedback.\n"
            "   - Capture the relevant request or job identifier.\n"
            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** Mismatched path rewrites or socket headers can break only one product surface.\n"
            "\n"
            "Suggested diagnostic signals: *upstream failures, request size rejections, and socket disconnects*. Compare them over the same time window.\n"
            "\n"
            "```text\n"
            "observe the symptom\n"
            "  -> identify the affected dependency\n"
            "  -> reproduce with test data\n"
            "  -> verify recovery from the user perspective\n"
            "```\n"
            "\n"
            "### Readiness checklist\n"
